OL,3,ANetanyahu bloc slightly ahead in Israel
OL,4,Aelections but short of majority as most
OL,5,Avotes counted
OL,6,
OL,7,FWith most votes counted, Netanyahu's
OL,8,Fbloc is slightly ahead - but neither it
OL,9,Fnor the opposition are on track for a
OL,10,Fmajority
OL,12,FNetanyahu is calling for a "strong"
OL,13,Fright-wing government and his Likud is
OL,14,Fset to be the biggest party. Eisenkot
OL,15,Fof the "change bloc" insists Israel
OL,16,Fvoted to end Netanyahu's term
OL,18,FParties led by Israel's Arab minority
OL,19,Fhave secured a record number of seats -
OL,20,Fand could emerge as kingmakers, our
OL,21,Fcorrespondent says
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/38
