OL,3,ANetanyahu bloc slightly ahead in Israel
OL,4,Aelections but short of majority as most
OL,5,Avotes counted
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoters have been giving their reactions
OL,8,Fto the BBC - from disappointment to
OL,9,Fcautious optimism and a sense of
OL,10,Fhistory being made
OL,12,FAll 120 seats in the Knesset, Israel's
OL,13,Fparliament, are up for grabs, but no
OL,14,Fparty has ever won a majority and in
OL,15,Fthe past governments have been made up
OL,16,Fof coalitions
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
